zizhan: backboardd's panel-sized BGRA canvases live in the loader's panel pool (pong_zc=1), step 3.1 of
docs/plan/2026-10-31-zero-copy-step3.md. The pool slots are handed out by drivers/PongAdreno/PongAdrenoScanout.cpp
(pong_panel_slot_take/give); the DPU can scan them directly (step 3.2). Stacks on 0001 (MiniIOSurface.cpp/.h); like 0002+ it is
reversed and re-applied by every build.

diff -ruN a/iokit/Kernel/MiniIOSurface.cpp b/iokit/Kernel/MiniIOSurface.cpp
--- a/iokit/Kernel/MiniIOSurface.cpp
+++ b/iokit/Kernel/MiniIOSurface.cpp
